      "tr": "Birleştirdikten sonra `joined[\"revenue\"] = joined[\"qty\"] * joined[\"price\"]`, `groupby(\"title\")[\"revenue\"].sum().to_dict()`.",
      "en": "After merging, `joined[\"revenue\"] = joined[\"qty\"] * joined[\"price\"]`, `groupby(\"title\")[\"revenue\"].sum().to_dict()`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\n\ndef revenue_by_title(sales, products):\n    left = pd.DataFrame(sales, columns=[\"product_id\", \"qty\"])\n    right = pd.DataFrame(products, columns=[\"id\", \"title\", \"price\"])\n    right[\"id\"] = right[\"id\"].astype(int)\n    joined = left.merge(right, left_on=\"product_id\", right_on=\"id\")\n    joined[\"revenue\"] = joined[\"qty\"] * joined[\"price\"]\n    return joined.groupby(\"title\")[\"revenue\"].sum().to_dict()\n\nSALES = [[1, 3], [2, 5], [1, 1]]\nPRODUCTS = [[\"1\", \"pen\", 2.5], [\"2\", \"cup\", 4.0], [\"3\", \"box\", 9.0]]\nprint(revenue_by_title(SALES, PRODUCTS))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\n\ndef revenue_by_title(sales, products):\n    left = pd.DataFrame(sales, columns=[\"product_id\", \"qty\"])\n    right = pd.DataFrame(products, columns=[\"id\", \"title\", \"price\"])\n    right[\"id\"] = right[\"id\"].astype(int)\n    joined = left.merge(right, left_on=\"product_id\", right_on=\"id\")\n    joined[\"revenue\"] = joined[\"qty\"] * joined[\"price\"]\n    return joined.groupby(\"title\")[\"revenue\"].sum().to_dict()\n\nSALES = [[1, 3], [2, 5], [1, 1]]\nPRODUCTS = [[\"1\", \"pen\", 2.5], [\"2\", \"cup\", 4.0], [\"3\", \"box\", 9.0]]\nprint(revenue_by_title(SALES, PRODUCTS))\n```"
